<title>UK: Genfinance adds 1.0 bln Lux francs to 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance adds 1.0 bln Lux francs to 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Generale Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE</p>
<p> AMT  * 4.0 BLN LUF   COUPON  ** 5.125     MATURITY    08.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.40    PAY DATE  L-08.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES    * LAUNCHED FOR 3.0 BLN LUF ON AUGUST 22</p>
<p>	   ** FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS AND TWO MONTHS, THEN 8.125 PCT</p>
<p>		L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW    LUX</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIP    0.25</p>
